  "definition": "Waste Transfer Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-10-04",
  "historyNote": "#5172, eff 7-1-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 400); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2105.03); ss by #10596, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14093, eff 10-4-24",
